          "docs": "\n## Description\nThis endpoint is a simplified version of the */user/{user_id}/progress*\nthat retrieves the progress for the currently logged in user.\nNote: Please bear in mind that the data retrieved is updated every hour and not in real time.\nThis API is deprecated: please use /v3/user/progress/ instead.\n"
