          "docs": "\n## Description\nYou must use the alphanumeric user_id as opposed to the deprecated numeric version. \nYou can find the alphanumeric user_id using the /v1/organizations/accounts/teams/{id}/members/ endpoint or in the Active and Invited Members report.\nAn enterprise member can view only their own progress.\nAn enterprise admin can also view the progress of any member of the company by passing their user_id.\nNote: Please bear in mind that the data retrieved is updated every hour and not in real time."
        },
